    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38731" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπερύω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 and 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπερ-ειρύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pull to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύρην δ᾽ ἐπέρυσσε κορώνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.441
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπρὶ στήλην ἐρύσαντες</span>
			<i>having dragged</i> a stone <i>to the top</i> [of the
			tumulus], <i><span class="en">
				12.14
			</span></i>; <i>draw</i> to one, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.149
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>draw on one's</i> clothes, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπειρυσάμενον τὴν λεοντέην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
